! Define the LineCode using per-mile matrices.
! OpenDSS expects Cmatrix in nF per unit length; it derives shunt susceptance
! internally from capacitance and the circuit frequency.
New LineCode.ug_11x14
~ Nphases=3
~ Units=mi
~ Rmatrix=[0.9102 | 0.3653 0.9061 | 0.3327 0.3653 0.9102]
~ Xmatrix=[0.4934 | 0.0668 0.4511 | 0.0162 0.0668 0.4934]
~ Cmatrix=[93.1595 | 0.0 93.1595 | 0.0 0.0 93.1595]
